cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Logistico in research or a publication, please cite it as below."
title: "Logistico: open-source delivery management system and courier app"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Haix02 and the Logistico contributors"
version: 3.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-02
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/Haix02/logistico-software"
url: "https://haix02.github.io/logistico-software/"
abstract: >-
  Logistico is an open-source delivery and logistics management system built for Iraq: orders from online shops,
  hubs and sort plans, line-haul trucks between governorates, a Flutter courier app with proof of delivery and
  barcode scanners, cash-on-delivery settlements, returns, public tracking, ASYCUDA customs and anonymised demand
  data. Arabic-first (right to left) with English.
keywords:
  - delivery management system
  - courier management
  - last-mile delivery
  - logistics
  - cash on delivery
  - proof of delivery
  - warehouse management
  - transportation management system
  - Iraq
  - Arabic
